        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An ideal opportunity for those seeking to design and build their new home, 3.5km from Quin village, 1.km to Norrie Henchy`s Cross on the main Tulla Road, 5.5km to the Tulla Road by-pass interchange & 6km to Ennis. \n\nPanoramic countryside views \nServices at Roadside \nSought-after location\nOnly 3.5km from Quin village \nThe site is offered for sale subject to planning permission. \n\nDirections: Proceed 6km (R353) out the main Tulla Road, turn right at Nora Hincheys\\`s Pub, proceed for 1km, take left and the site is on your right indicated by our sign. House is next to eircode V95 Y5R7."
